afety inspections of buildings over 15 years old. Owners are required to have their structures inspected by qualified engineers and submit certificates. Previous attempts at enforcing compliance have not been effective, with little action taken by building management. Without strict enforcement, voluntary compliance remains low, hindering safety protocols.", "href": "https://realty.economictimes.indiatimes.com/news/infrastructure/ahmedabad-civic-body-renews-push-for-building-safety/134956619?utm_source=newslisting&utm_medium=latestNews", "img": "data:image/png;base64, ", "img-src": "https://etimg.etb2bimg.com/thumb/img-size-206840/134956619.cms?width=150&height=112", "tag": "infrastructure"}]}